RecompOne change for MediEvilRecomp ITA: scene lights from 3D additive polygons.
Additive textured quads that already have native 3D positions (fire arrow trails, fire, magic)
become SceneLights for slang shaders, like anchored billboards already do.
Author: https://github.com/Leproide
License of this change: GPL-3.0-or-later (RecompOne code itself keeps its own license).
Apply after shader-gbuffer.patch:  git -C RecompOne apply ../recompone-fixes/effect-lights.patch

